      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd like to update and confirm on the situation that the problem was resolved *temporarily* after deleting and re-importing the somehow problematic gameobjects/prefabs back into the PlayerObject pool.\n\nAs far as I've been told the problem was related to some duplicate Network IDs (Despite the fact I have regenerated and even cleared on many occasions my Network ID list.) being detected by VRChat and therefore causing the error.\n\n*So I wouldn't be surprised if the problem comes back if I mess with anything else inside my PlayerObject pool again.",
