      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Tell me more \"Unusual Client Behavior\" because it has completely broke my world. Makes me not want to make worlds anymore. No one explains how to fix this but you. I don't understand what you did. I don't understand what's going on. I don't understand the Networking in worlds. What is a PlayerObject \"pool\"?",
